 163:CMSIS/Devices/STM32F7xx/Src/system_stm32f7xx.c **** 
 164:CMSIS/Devices/STM32F7xx/Src/system_stm32f7xx.c **** /**
 165:CMSIS/Devices/STM32F7xx/Src/system_stm32f7xx.c ****    * @brief  Update SystemCoreClock variable according to Clock Register Values.
 166:CMSIS/Devices/STM32F7xx/Src/system_stm32f7xx.c ****   *         The SystemCoreClock variable contains the core clock (HCLK), it can
 167:CMSIS/Devices/STM32F7xx/Src/system_stm32f7xx.c ****   *         be used by the user application to setup the SysTick timer or configure
 168:CMSIS/Devices/STM32F7xx/Src/system_stm32f7xx.c ****   *         other parameters.
 169:CMSIS/Devices/STM32F7xx/Src/system_stm32f7xx.c ****   *           
 170:CMSIS/Devices/STM32F7xx/Src/system_stm32f7xx.c ****   * @note   Each time the core clock (HCLK) changes, this function must be called
 171:CMSIS/Devices/STM32F7xx/Src/system_stm32f7xx.c ****   *         to update SystemCoreClock variable value. Otherwise, any configuration
 172:CMSIS/Devices/STM32F7xx/Src/system_stm32f7xx.c ****   *         based on this variable will be incorrect.         
 173:CMSIS/Devices/STM32F7xx/Src/system_stm32f7xx.c ****   *     
ARM GAS  C:\Users\silve\AppData\Local\Temp\ccKS4O7Q.s 			page 5


 174:CMSIS/Devices/STM32F7xx/Src/system_stm32f7xx.c ****   * @note   - The system frequency computed by this function is not the real 
 175:CMSIS/Devices/STM32F7xx/Src/system_stm32f7xx.c ****   *           frequency in the chip. It is calculated based on the predefined 
 176:CMSIS/Devices/STM32F7xx/Src/system_stm32f7xx.c ****   *           constant and the selected clock source:
 177:CMSIS/Devices/STM32F7xx/Src/system_stm32f7xx.c ****   *             
 178:CMSIS/Devices/STM32F7xx/Src/system_stm32f7xx.c ****   *           - If SYSCLK source is HSI, SystemCoreClock will contain the HSI_VALUE(*)
 179:CMSIS/Devices/STM32F7xx/Src/system_stm32f7xx.c ****   *                                              
 180:CMSIS/Devices/STM32F7xx/Src/system_stm32f7xx.c ****   *           - If SYSCLK source is HSE, SystemCoreClock will contain the HSE_VALUE(**)
 181:CMSIS/Devices/STM32F7xx/Src/system_stm32f7xx.c ****   *                          
 182:CMSIS/Devices/STM32F7xx/Src/system_stm32f7xx.c ****   *           - If SYSCLK source is PLL, SystemCoreClock will contain the HSE_VALUE(**) 
 183:CMSIS/Devices/STM32F7xx/Src/system_stm32f7xx.c ****   *             or HSI_VALUE(*) multiplied/divided by the PLL factors.
 184:CMSIS/Devices/STM32F7xx/Src/system_stm32f7xx.c ****   *         
 185:CMSIS/Devices/STM32F7xx/Src/system_stm32f7xx.c ****   *         (*) HSI_VALUE is a constant defined in stm32f7xx_hal_conf.h file (default value
 186:CMSIS/Devices/STM32F7xx/Src/system_stm32f7xx.c ****   *             16 MHz) but the real value may vary depending on the variations
 187:CMSIS/Devices/STM32F7xx/Src/system_stm32f7xx.c ****   *             in voltage and temperature.   
